<h1 class="visually-hidden">About {{ site.name }}</h1>
<div class="about-body">
  {% homePhoto site.photoAlt %}
  <div class="about-bio">
    <p>Hey, I'm Ben! I'm currently studying computer engineering at UMD.</p>
    <p>These days I'm building software that helps underrepresented students build fulfilling lives and careers. I'm also doing a deep dive on AI safety, ML systems, and networking, partly by turning a Raspberry Pi and an old gaming PC into a home lab.</p>
    <p>I know technology can improve people's lives. I want to keep spending my time on fulfilling and high-impact problems.</p>
    <p>Outside of work I meditate, run, and snowboard. I think a lot about perception, ego, and how technology changes the way we see the world.</p>
    <p>I write <a href="{{ site.substack }}">here</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="/about/more/">More about me</a>.</p>
    {%- if assets.signature %}
    <div class="signature" role="img" aria-label="{{ site.name }}'s signature" style="--sig-ratio: {{ assets.signatureRatio }}"></div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</div>
